/// `load`, `store`, `swap`, `compare_exchange`, `compare_exchange_weak`,
/// `fetch_add`, `fetch_add_wrapping`, `fetch_sub`, `fetch_sub_wrapping`,
/// `fetch_or`, `fetch_and`, `fetch_xor`, `fetch_nand`, `fetch_max`, and `fetch_min`.
